# OksaSDR tour, "On the air": RADE on 80 m, 3.625: CT2HFZ and CT2IOK in a QSO (FreeDV Reporter, 2026-11-13 01:40),
# tuned from the list's frequency, RADE on (DIGL below 10 MHz, as FreeDV's convention). Receive only.
pin 5
record 15
caption !speed 3
caption # On the air
ready
wait 4000
caption !speed 1
caption FreeDV: RADE digital voice, decoded in the app. The FreeDV section lists the stations on FreeDV Reporter; a tap on one tunes there and turns RADE on.
taptext FreeDV ~1263,141
taptext View ~1324,82
wait 2500
taptext All bands
wait 6000
caption FreeDV: RADE digital voice, decoded in the app.
freq 3.625
mode DIGU
span 10
wait 1500
tapname radeButton
wait 1500
caption 80 m, 3.625 MHz: RADE stations in a QSO, as FreeDV Reporter lists them; their voice comes through the app.
wait 150000
caption !rade-off
tapname radeButton
wait 2000
taptext This band
wait 800
taptext View ~1324,82
taptext FreeDV ~1263,141
caption -
record off
freq 14.074
mode DIGU
wait 2000
slices
